{"c":"431037","n":"OHŘE 16","t":"M","s":"ZČ","o":"Sokolov","url":"431037-ohre-16","stav":"2026-10-03","popis":"GPS Z: 50°11'4.089\"N, 12°42'52.768\"E, K: 50°7'25.626\"N, 12°31'39.894\"E\nPřítok Labe. Od lávky ve Starém Sedle u Lokte nad Ohří (ř. km 196,3) až k jezu v Kynšperku nad Ohří (ř. km 218,6). K revíru patří i přilehlá ramena po celé délce toku. V obecném zájmu je zákaz lovu ryb v úseku na pravém břehu řeky Ohře v délce 500 m při zařízení Českého rybářství Mariánské Lázně (ř. km 208,0) – vyznačeno tabulemi. Lov ryb z plavidel povolen. Potok Lobezský (ústí do Ohře na ř. km 203,0) je chovný – lov ryb zakázán.","delka":22,"rozloha":74,"lat":50.156519,"lon":12.621203,"mo_web":"https://www.crssokolov.cz/","mo_tel":"792305793","mo_mail":"crssokolov@seznam.cz","doba":[{"od":"2026-10-01","do":"2026-12-31","h":"05:00–22:00","zakaz":false}],"kratkodobe":[],"miry":[{"d":"Amur bílý","min":50,"max":null,"hajen":false,"od":"2026-01-01","do":"2026-12-31","pozn":""},{"d":"Bolen dravý","min":40,"max":null,"hajen":false,"od":"2026-06-16","do":"2026-12-31","pozn":""},{"d":"Candát obecný","min":45,"max":null,"hajen":false,"od":"2026-06-16","do":"2026-12-31","pozn":""},{"d":"Cejn velký","min":null,"max":null,"hajen":false,"od":"2026-01-01","do":"2026-12-31","pozn":""},{"d":"Hlavatka obecná","min":65,"max":null,"hajen":false,"od":"2026-10-01","do":"2026-12-31","pozn":""},{"d":"Jelec jesen","min":null,"max":null,"hajen":true,"od":"2026-01-01","do":"2026-12-31","pozn":""},{"d":"Jelec tloušť","min":25,"max":null,"hajen":false,"od":"2026-06-16","do":"2026-12-31","pozn":""},{"d":"Jeseter malý","min":30,"max":null,"hajen":false,"od":"2026-06-16","do":"2026-12-31","pozn":""},{"d":"Kapr obecný","min":40,"max":70,"hajen":false,"od":"2026-01-01","do":"2026-12-31","pozn":""},{"d":"Lín obecný","min":20,"max":null,"hajen":false,"od":"2026-01-01","do":"2026-12-31","pozn":""},{"d":"Lipan podhorní","min":30,"max":null,"hajen":false,"od":"2026-06-16","do":"2026-11-30","pozn":""},{"d":"Losos obecný